<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait bourse to close five days for Moslem feast.</title>
<headline>Kuwait bourse to close five days for Moslem feast.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kuwait Stock Exchange will close for five days starting April 16 to mark the Moslem Eid al-Adha feast, officials said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Banks operating in Kuwait and government offices will also close during the same period.</p>
</text>
